335
00:17:57,730 --> 00:18:01,730
Suspension Trauma is also known as Harness Hanged Syndrome.

336
00:18:01,930 --> 00:18:08,930
When a worker works with a safety harness and because of any mistake, he or she will not be able to move.

337
00:18:08,930 --> 00:18:16,930
When a worker works with a safety harness and because of any mistake, he or she will not be able to move.

338
00:18:17,130 --> 00:18:26,130
If a rescue team does not come up to 15 minutes and the worker is stuck in the harness, then the worker suffers from Suspension Trauma.

339
00:18:26,330 --> 00:18:31,330
Because of being stuck in the harness, the leg strap becomes quite tight.

340
00:18:31,330 --> 00:18:36,330
Because of which, the arteries or your leg is blocked.

341
00:18:36,530 --> 00:18:38,530
Because of which, the blood flow stops.

342
00:18:38,730 --> 00:18:41,730
Because of which, the legs become paralyzed.

343
00:18:41,930 --> 00:18:44,930
This effect is called Suspension Trauma.

344
00:18:45,130 --> 00:18:48,130
Next, Suspension Trauma Safety Strap.

345
00:18:48,330 --> 00:18:54,330
Suspension Trauma Safety Strap is designed so that the worker can be saved from Suspension Trauma.

346
00:18:54,330 --> 00:19:01,330
This is a strap which the worker can put in his legs and give relief to the arteries and veins during the hanging.

347
00:19:01,530 --> 00:19:04,530
It does not cause blood clots and the worker remains safe.

